T:See, The Lord Ascends In Triumph
T:REX GLORIAE
C:Music: Henry Thomas Smart, 1868 · Words: Christopher Wordsworth, 1862, alt
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Appendix to Hymns Ancient and Modern", 1869 Hymn 293. Text is the same as "Appendix to Hymns Ancient and Modern" with the exception of the title. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/rex_gloriae_smart) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
